        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midnight at Grimmi's is a free fan project focused on and dedicated to some of my favorite indie VTubers. The game is a Reverse Bullet Hell or a Survivor-Like with a customizable hub. Mix and match your Character, Companion and Weapon for unique loadouts and synergies. Collect Relics and other Power-ups to defeat waves of enemies. You'll need all these tools an more in your quest to survive 7 nights in the evil witch's bog!</p>",
